title: 'sp-keystore: MemoryKeystore signs only with a secret URI that derives the queried key'
doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Runtime Dev]
    description: |
      The testing MemoryKeystore no longer signs with a stored secret URI that derives a
      different public key than the one queried, and no longer panics on an unparseable secret
      URI. Such an entry is treated as absent: sign and VRF methods return Ok(None) and the
      public key listings skip it.
crates:
  - name: sp-keystore
    bump: patch
